    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">Inspector Hector Salgado is known for his violent moments. He has a murky emotional past and a runaway wife. So he is moved off his current case to investigate the story behind a young boy&apos;s fall to his death from a balcony in one of Barcelona&apos;s uptown areas. Salgado digs deeper, poking at the the seedy underbelly of Spain&apos;s most popular city, to unearth a case of human traffiking and voodoo. But Hector&apos;s fierce, complex personality (with his passion for cinema) and a seemingly unresolvable case are set to implode under Barcelona&apos;s hot sun.</marc:subfield>
